{"pull": {"id": "number:20738", "number": 20738, "title": "KAFKA-19808: Handle batch alignment when share partition is at capacity", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:31:14Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-21T14:42:00Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-21T14:42:00Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The PR fixes couple of issues which are related to the batch alignment:\n\n1. Base offset not found for some acquisition lock timeouts.\n2. Gaps reported by client when the topic cannot have any gaps.\n\nThe root cause was the misaligned batches when cache is full but the\nfetch happens in middle of cached offsets i.e. some records are released\nbecause of acquisition lock time out or expilicitly. As the subsequent\nfetch can have lesser bytes of data but the method\n`lastOffsetAndMaxRecordsToAcquire` aligned the lastOffsetToAcquire to\n`endOffset` hence incorrect batches were created. The PR fixes that by\nadding a `min` comparison.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Abhinav Dixit\n <adixit@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20738"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}